summary:
  A search result being tried is watched like a saved station.

history:
  An audition is nobody's standing order, so nothing asks whether it is
  still wanted: one left playing under a closed lid would be found dead in
  the morning and put on again through the identity road.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StandLogic.js

find:
   && f.episode === false && f.audition === false;

replace:
   && f.episode === false;

expect:
  Killed by tst_standlogic::test_what_is_not_the_broadcast_is_not_watched.
  Line-neutral.
